Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:10.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This should be far enough \Naway from civilization,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.87,0:00:13.13,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,considering I don't know \Nwhat's about to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:16.08,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A job-change quest...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:20.54,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's the quest that showed up after \NI passed level 40 from the last raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:25.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've run into two dungeons \Naccessible with key items before,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:28.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but the only quests I've been forced \Nto take on immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:32.09,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,were the penalty and emergency ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:39.39,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This one, however, seems to be optional, \Nand I've been given time to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.35,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Should I assume that means it's going \Nto be that much more difficult?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:47.65,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The logical assumption is that this is an \Nimportant event that'll make me stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.74,0:00:51.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,by earning skills best suited to my job...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:55.89,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.27,0:01:11.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot, my daily quest...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:14.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess I can do it when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:20.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,All right. Looks like \Nthe real game starts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.03,0:01:23.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I wonder what's waiting for me inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.02,0:01:25.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Should be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:19.83,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,I apologize for the delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:22.84,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,No, you're right on time, Jinsung.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.87,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Jinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:27.44,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.15,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The dungeon seems surprisingly normal so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:40.57,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can't use potions or full recovery?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:44.01,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Or leave until the quest is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:46.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need to be pretty careful, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:03:59.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,An armor-type beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.31,0:04:18.50,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That didn't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:35.20,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:40.13,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've fought enemies...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.48,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,with hard exteriors before!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:05:00.67,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I wasted a use of Fatal Strike...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:03.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and when I can't recover mana \Nor heal damage, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.15,0:05:06.07,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:10.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's not like they care, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:16.30,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,What is it, Jinho?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:18.80,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,You've barely touched your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:20.56,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:25.07,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,Jinsung, how are things going \Nwith establishing the guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.07,0:05:30.11,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,I've heard the S-Ranks you've been \Nmaking offers to have all declined.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:34.93,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,It's true that Hunters Min Byung-gu \Nand Cha Hae-in turned me down,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.93,0:05:36.23,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,but it won't be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.97,0:05:41.76,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,I've got negotiations underway with \NEuropean and Middle Eastern hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:45.54,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,They're likely to sign \Nif we agree to their terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:47.89,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,It'll be similar to the case \Nof Hunter Hwang Dongsoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:48.91,Default,Yoo Myunghan,0,0,0,,You've got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:52.01,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Hunters from overseas. Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.53,0:05:55.62,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,Jinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:06:00.50,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,I know you've been working on \Nsomething of your own in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:03.63,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,Buying up the rights to all these \NC-Rank raids at a high price,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:06.14,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,trying to establish your credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:09.10,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,And that's fine, for a personal project, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:12.31,Default,Yoo Jinsung,0,0,0,,Don't even think about getting in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:19.48,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,He doesn't know about the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:23.08,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,If he had any idea of the kind of power \NI have on my side...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:34.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess even I get tired \Nafter this much combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:36.38,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Better catch my breath—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:39.86,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The Stealth skill?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:43.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've gotta deal with beasts \Nthat can use that, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:48.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,On top of that, there's a mage...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:50.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and one that uses light magic, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.01,0:06:54.18,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The stealth skill and light magic... \NWhat is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:59.31,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That armor reminded me of the Kasaka, too. \NIt's like I'm revisiting my past battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:04.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This quest is even tougher than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:09.92,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The different kinds of beast \Nall have different weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:14.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Knights require strength, assassins take \Nperception, archers need agility...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:19.07,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Without enough strength, \Nthe knights won't take damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:25.14,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Without enough perception, \Nthe assassins can't be detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:29.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And the real issue is the mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:34.60,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They probably need intellect as a counter, \Nbut I haven't really invested in that stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:36.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Which means I don't have much mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.48,0:07:38.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need to conserve my skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.45,0:07:44.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but my fatigue is starting to build up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:46.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need to end this soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:02.09,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I see you're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.45,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,The time has finally come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:19.39,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm just glad the beasts \Ndrop stuff like this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A High-Rank Knight's Chestplate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:27.99,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I haven't really \Nexperimented with gear much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It can turn invisible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:37.93,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm glad I don't have to stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:42.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Looks like it doesn't restrict \Nmy movement, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:47.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's kind of hard to tell without being \Nfully restored, but my level has gone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:50.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've got plenty of gold and items, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:56.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,With my fatigue recovered, \NI may as well move onto the next stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:05.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:10.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How bad is it gonna be \Non the other side of this door?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:18.70,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But if I can't get out of here without \Ngetting through, I just have to press on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:28.18,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Something about that gust \Njust gave me the chills...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:48.24,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Some kind of throne room?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:59.50,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This sight, these sounds, the way it feels...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.71,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My entire body remembers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:06.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This is pressure on the level of what \NI felt during the double dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:16.18,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And all of that intensity \Nis coming from this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:20.23,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"Knight Commander Igris the Bloodred."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.75,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Name's red, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:26.86,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He really is nothing like \Nthe enemies I've fought so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:30.81,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A knight who defends an empty throne...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:38.24,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:50.80,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He chops through pillars \Nlike they're dry branches!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.14,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This is beyond just strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:15.06,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,To be able to move this quickly, \Nin that heavy armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.11,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:30.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Still no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:45.35,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We're equals in terms of speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:47.70,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But he's much more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:51.55,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And because of that armor, \Nmy dagger isn't doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:54.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Do I have any way of beating this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:58.57,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He's even more dangerous than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.11,0:12:00.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:03.66,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I doubt I can win without a weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:09.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but this is the only way I can think of \Nto deal any damage through that armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.79,0:12:18.51,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess you're being chivalrous, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.73,0:12:21.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You must think this is gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:27.56,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:31.15,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Chairman, you still haven't gone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:33.80,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I don't feel like calling it a day just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:36.85,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,So I've been dealing with \Na bit of work that's piled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:38.58,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:41.62,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I've been clearing some \Nnon-urgent items off my plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:45.11,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,So it's finally happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.11,0:12:46.08,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:49.36,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:52.53,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I'm here. Are you heading out soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.53,0:12:53.29,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:55.52,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:13:00.01,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I'm grateful you approved this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:01.76,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,No thanks necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:05.55,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,It's all because you've kept Jeju Island's \Nname afloat in the interviews
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:09.19,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,you've been doing on TV and in print.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:14.28,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,That's kept it in the public's consciousness \Nand is swaying their opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:18.74,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,All I did was help tip the scales a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:22.37,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,You don't expect criticism \Nfor kicking a hornet's nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.37,0:13:24.45,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to take the brunt of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.81,0:13:26.43,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Just be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:28.78,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Jeju Island is dangerous business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:30.79,DefaultItalics,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I'm fully aware, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:33.76,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,This expedition is about \Nassessing threat levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:38.20,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,We'll prod the enemy and see how \Nand to what degree they respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:41.01,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,As diligent as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:43.41,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,The third raid on Jeju Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:46.44,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,To me, that battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.18,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,never really ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:00.15,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:27.88,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Even though I blocked, \Nit felt like that took down 500 HP!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:31.10,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I made the right move putting armor on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:35.17,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There's a chance taking it \Nfull on would've killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:38.68,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,For him to deal this kind of damage \Neven without his sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:40.26,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,He's too damn strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:47.86,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I can't compete in terms of power, \Nthen I'll boost my speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.01,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can't catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:15.10,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That passive skill boosted my defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.63,0:16:34.03,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,That oughta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:29.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:32.29,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,haven't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:36.08,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,lost yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:59.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That dagger can't change owners like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.67,0:18:01.42,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It'll go back into my inventory,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:02.44,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and then back into my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:07.03,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Too shallow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:08.23,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Have to stab deeper!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:40.35,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I won... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.03,0:18:47.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That... was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:52.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My winning was pretty much a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:55.88,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,In terms of skills, ability, and experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:58.82,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There was a real difference \Nbetween us on every level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:01.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,One screwup, and I'd probably be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:04.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Four rewards, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:08.14,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A pouch with 1,500,000 gold in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.45,0:19:13.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The same helmet that Igris had... \Nand it's an S-Rank item!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:16.32,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The key to the Demon's Castle \Nwas S-Rank, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:19.72,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but I've never had gear \Nof that quality before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:22.93,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It reduces physical damage by 15%,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:25.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,along with a 20-point boost \Nto strength and vitality!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.76,0:19:26.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:30.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Along with a rune stone \Nfor the Ruler's Hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:35.11,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What kind of skill is that? \NI guess I'll figure it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:37.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But what about...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:39.95,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,this "instant teleportation stone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:42.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It won't go into the inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.18,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Why give me a teleportation stone now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.07,0:19:51.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Is... Is the job-change quest...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:54.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,not over yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:05.08,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"Survive as long as possible"? \N"Enhancement points"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:06.86,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And what is a "higher class"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.70,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"Good luck," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:14.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wait, am I facing infinite \Nwaves of enemies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:24.58,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If they were as strong as Igris, \NI would've been overwhelmed in seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.09,0:20:28.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But these guys? \NI can handle them easily enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:31.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Still... There's an awful lot of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:52.31,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Damn it! I keep fighting, but the gates \Nkeep puking up more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:56.78,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I think the key to this quest \Nis how long you can last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:58.03,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.59,0:21:05.57,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Stealth costs 200 mana to activate, \Nand then one for each second of use...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.01,0:21:08.37,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I have 190 left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll buy as much time as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:17.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They saw through Stealth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:28.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This is worse than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.83,0:21:31.44,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I won't be able to use Stealth \Nor Murderous Intent anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.86,0:21:39.05,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:41.49,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Only five minutes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.96,0:21:43.34,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can't keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:46.03,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I hate to do it, but I'd better use \Nthat teleportation stone...
